Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.50,Hormozi,,0,0,0,,Esqueça tudo o que você
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.50,0:00:03.40,Hormozi,,0,0,0,,já viu sobre peso na {\c&H00D7FF&}balança{\c&H00FFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:05.50,Hormozi,,0,0,0,,A {\c&H00D7FF&}balança{\c&H00FFFFFF&} comum de farmácia
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.50,0:00:07.60,Hormozi,,0,0,0,,só te mostra um número cego
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.60,0:00:09.40,Hormozi,,0,0,0,,que mente sobre o seu corpo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.40,0:00:12.30,Hormozi,,0,0,0,,A nova {\c&H00D7FF&}balança{\c&H00FFFFFF&} de bioimpedância Xiaomi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.30,0:00:14.70,Hormozi,,0,0,0,,escaneia {\c&H00D7FF&}13 biomarcadores{\c&H00FFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.70,0:00:17.60,Hormozi,,0,0,0,,com sensores de precisão médica:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.60,0:00:19.50,Hormozi,,0,0,0,,massa muscular real,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.50,0:00:21.60,Hormozi,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00D7FF&}gordura visceral{\c&H00FFFFFF&} oculta,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:25.50,Hormozi,,0,0,0,,hidratação celular e {\c&H00D7FF&}metabolismo{\c&H00FFFFFF&} basal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.50,0:00:27.60,Hormozi,,0,0,0,,E o grande diferencial,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.60,0:00:29.20,Hormozi,,0,0,0,,ao subir nela,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.20,0:00:31.70,Hormozi,,0,0,0,,a minha {\c&H00D7FF&}inteligência artificial{\c&H00FFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.70,0:00:34.00,Hormozi,,0,0,0,,assume o controle no seu {\c&H00D7FF&}WhatsApp{\c&H00FFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.00,0:00:36.60,Hormozi,,0,0,0,,Eu analiso sua evolução
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.60,0:00:38.60,Hormozi,,0,0,0,,em {\c&H00D7FF&}tempo real{\c&H00FFFFFF&},
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.60,0:00:40.70,Hormozi,,0,0,0,,calculo as proteínas dos seus pratos
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.70,0:00:42.60,Hormozi,,0,0,0,,por foto em {\c&H00D7FF&}3 segundos{\c&H00FFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.60,0:00:44.20,Hormozi,,0,0,0,,e calibro seus treinos
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.20,0:00:45.80,Hormozi,,0,0,0,,dia após dia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.80,0:00:48.00,Hormozi,,0,0,0,,Garantindo a sua {\c&H00D7FF&}balança{\c&H00FFFFFF&} oficial hoje,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:49.70,Hormozi,,0,0,0,,você leva {\c&H00D7FF&}3 meses{\c&H00FFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.70,0:00:51.20,Hormozi,,0,0,0,,de {\c&H00D7FF&}mentoria VIP{\c&H00FFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.20,0:00:53.20,Hormozi,,0,0,0,,inteiramente {\c&H00D7FF&}grátis{\c&H00FFFFFF&} direto
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.20,0:00:55.00,Hormozi,,0,0,0,,no meu {\c&H00D7FF&}WhatsApp{\c&H00FFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.00,0:00:57.20,Hormozi,,0,0,0,,O futuro da sua saúde chegou.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.20,0:00:59.70,Hormozi,,0,0,0,,Acesse marcalpersonal.com
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.70,0:01:01.30,Hormozi,,0,0,0,,ou clique no {\c&H00D7FF&}link da bio{\c&H00FFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.30,0:01:02.50,Hormozi,,0,0,0,,agora mesmo.
